REMAP_ESMF is a tools that essentially allow the user to use the ESMF remapping fortran librairy 
    to remap netcdf field from a chosen source to a destination grid. See the namelist_remap file 
    for more information on the option available. 

    Nicolas Lambert, Jan 2023


To install: 
    $ make all

To execute 
    $ source fenv # only once
    $ ./remap.exe
